  {
   "id": "static-dread-the-lighthouse-330815@1.1",
   "gameId": "static-dread-the-lighthouse-330815",
   "displayName": "Patch 1.1",
   "kind": "patch",
   "kindBasis": "studio",
   "announcedAt": "2025-09-22T17:53:09.000Z",
   "notes": [
    {
     "title": "Friends, thank you for your positive feedback!",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "We have prepared the first major patch for Static Dread, where we focused on the most frustrating design elements.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Reworked the balance of fish and a coffee pot compared to other items.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "balance"
      },
      {
       "text": "Improved the flashlight, a hint appears in the dark.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "Rebalanced the inscriptions on the walls. They have less of an impact on the paranormal atmosphere, and the game does not distract you with them as much.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "balance"
      },
      {
       "text": "[img src=\"{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/45270007/37550a5c200f62842b85daeb1b45dd67e9329643.jpg\"]",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "The tentacles have become more dangerous: they slow down the player and have a stronger effect on the mind. We have added a new type — from the ceiling, trying to grab you.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "[img src=\"{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/45270007/7e1a04acc97ea9bad60706c30e4cc979d6171f2e.gif\"]",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "The beholder has been improved in the second part of the game. Hide from it in a locker!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "[img src=\"{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/45270007/b6d04b3c1a5747df5be9c5f8ad1daa7ffed7a0ee.gif\"]",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "The text has been revised in many places, and localization has been fixed. Thanks to the community, Portuguese, French, and Spanish have been greatly improved.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Machine translation into German, Turkish, and Korean has been significantly improved.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "[img src=\"{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/45270007/b383371893872ee56829652cddd28f7f85eed761.jpg\"]",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "Plus minor changes",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "The noise effect does not remain on the screen if consciousness is not spent.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Improved sounds when erasing inscriptions and in many other places.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "Improved UX: quick exit from windows and fax.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "Fixed bugs with the table: localization error when changing languages, when interacting quickly with pieces of paper.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "Low graphics settings have been refined for weak hardware. The game looks better on older video cards without fog support.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Logical errors with cultists have been removed. They can be sent to dangerous areas without penalty.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "[img src=\"{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/45270007/b9172f68dc5b50b4c518d8b3b779422f915b5721.jpg\"]",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "We continue to improve Static Dread, so feel free to leave your feedback!",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "P.S. Also, if you love combination of narrative and action, please wishlist our other game — Drake Frontier!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "[dynamiclink href=\"https://store.steampowered.com/app/1735880/Drake_Frontier/\"]",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "##",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    }
   ],
