     "items": [
      {
       "text": "We’ve been collecting your feedback, polishing things up, and we’re finally ready to show you what we’ve got! A new demo build is live — spanning three in‑game nights and packed with fresh mechanics. We’d love to hear your thoughts in the survey or on Discord.",
